        "original_id": "eae71e86-80e0-5b6a-89ae-97d583fd0aad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William McGrath\n- Organizations: Tara, Orange Order\n- Places: Northern Ireland\n- Concepts: Ulster loyalism, unionism, British monarchy, united Ireland\n\nFacts:\n- William McGrath was born on 11 December 1916 and died in 1992.\n- William McGrath was a loyalist from Northern Ireland.\n- In the 1960s, William McGrath founded the far-right organization Tara.\n- William McGrath had been prominent in the Orange Order until the Orange Order expelled him due to his paedophilia.\n- Ulster loyalists, like unionists, are attached to the British monarchy.\n- Ulster loyalists support the continued existence of Northern Ireland.\n- Ulster loyalists oppose a united Ireland.",
